\f0\fs24 \cf2 The studio of the Bagatti Valsecchi brothers, located on the noble floor, is a captivating space dominated by a monumental portal characterized by a broken tympanum with elegant curves and fragmented lines. We hold two original drawings of the portal: one precise and detailed, the other more theatrical, emphasized with watercolor shades. Every element of the portal was designed to create a visual impact that foreshadows the beauty and elegance found inside the house. The residence has never been a mere dwelling but rather an architectural masterpiece born from the ingenuity and passion of the Bagatti Valsecchi brothers, which continues to surprise us to this day.\
